      "content": "i tried that. i sat in a dark room for hours but it doesn't work. the thoughts just get louder. even when it's quiet outside, it's like my brain is screaming at me. nothing helps. i feel like i'm just stuck in this constant, vibrating chaos and there's no way to actually make it stop. it's like i'm trapped in it.",
